OL,3,GNEWSAMixed reaction to plans for
OL,4,Amustard factory revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major regeneration of the former
OL,7,FColman's mustard factory has been
OL,8,Fwelcomed, but the housing plans are
OL,9,Fsparking concerns about traffic at a
OL,10,Fbottleneck roundabout.
OL,12,FMore details have emerged about the
OL,13,FHomes England-backed scheme in Norwich,
OL,14,Fwhich will demolish parts of the site
OL,15,Fand build up to 3,500 homes.
OL,17,FA key access point will be from the
OL,18,FMartineau Lane roundabout, which also
OL,19,Fprovides access to neighbouring Trowse.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
