OL,3,GNEWSAMixed reaction to plans for
OL,4,Amustard factory revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut at a first public event showcasing
OL,7,Fthe plans, villagers living there told
OL,8,Fthe BBC while they wanted to see it
OL,9,Fregenerated, they worried about the
OL,10,Ftraffic it would bring.
